      "year": 2024,
      "abstract": "This paper carries out the research of the MBSE method based on the DoDAF modeling framework, focusing on the whole process of aircraft testing and evaluation. From eight points of view, the business, resources, standards, capabilities, and data of flight tests are designed and planned, the management model with the characteristics of development and evaluation flight test is constructed, and the model-based test flight engineering is explored. This method can standardize the whole cycle of development test and evaluation, effectively improve the efficiency of testing and evaluation, reduce the cost of testing, and shorten the test cycle.",
